    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078430/extras/c5b61af336bc0a87c59ec02dcda4822e.avif?t=1732618875\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Luminedge </i></strong>is an intense and deadly combat experience set in a sci-fi feudal universe. Engage in exhilarating duels and epic battles in a brutal dance of steel and energy in a neon-drenched age of lords and lasers. Wield your Luminedge, and prove your mettle in the battle for supremacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078430/extras/52063b85e302c90b64366fd9931b1fa5.poster.avif?t=1732618875\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078430/extras/52063b85e302c90b64366fd9931b1fa5.webm?t=1732618875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078430/extras/52063b85e302c90b64366fd9931b1fa5.mp4?t=1732618875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Precise-Collision Combat System</i>: Master a versatile combat system where precision and timing are key to overcoming your foes. The weapon collision-based system ensures that every clash of weapons is a calculated maneuver. To parry an attack, you don't just press a button \u2013 you physically position your weapon to intercept and block the incoming strike. This realistic approach to combat means every duel is a thrilling encounter, where mastery of your weapon's defense and attack capabilities defines your success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Multiplayer Battles</i>: Challenge friends and foes in various multiplayer modes. Prove your dominance in one-on-one duels or engage in larger, chaotic skirmishes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Conquest Campaign</i>: Conquer the vast lands of Valia, solo or in co-op. Navigate through interconnected nodes to conquer diverse areas, including fiefs, fortresses, and cities. Lead your army, ride powerful steeds, or operate advanced vehicles to dominate the battlefield. Conquer and manage nodes to earn Shards, the essential currency for your campaign. Spend Shards on new units, powerful perks, and upgrades to bolster your forces and gain the upper hand in the war.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Customization and Progression</i>: Tailor your warrior\u2019s appearance and abilities. Unlock new weapons, armor, and cosmetics as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A Sci-Fi Feudal Realm</i>: Fight in stages where futuristic landscapes are fused with feudal aesthetics and traditions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078430/extras/a6e378a8623efc3d34ea72b91422505c.poster.avif?t=1732618875\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078430/extras/a6e378a8623efc3d34ea72b91422505c.webm?t=1732618875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078430/extras/a6e378a8623efc3d34ea72b91422505c.mp4?t=1732618875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Community</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become part of the Luminedge community and share your experiences, strategies, and feedback. Follow us on social media, join our forums, and participate in our events to stay up-to-date with the latest news and updates.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078430/extras/c5b61af336bc0a87c59ec02dcda4822e.avif?t=1732618875\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Luminedge </i></strong>is an intense and deadly combat experience set in a sci-fi feudal universe. Engage in exhilarating duels and epic battles in a brutal dance of steel and energy in a neon-drenched age of lords and lasers. Wield your Luminedge, and prove your mettle in the battle for supremacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078430/extras/52063b85e302c90b64366fd9931b1fa5.poster.avif?t=1732618875\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078430/extras/52063b85e302c90b64366fd9931b1fa5.webm?t=1732618875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078430/extras/52063b85e302c90b64366fd9931b1fa5.mp4?t=1732618875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Precise-Collision Combat System</i>: Master a versatile combat system where precision and timing are key to overcoming your foes. The weapon collision-based system ensures that every clash of weapons is a calculated maneuver. To parry an attack, you don't just press a button \u2013 you physically position your weapon to intercept and block the incoming strike. This realistic approach to combat means every duel is a thrilling encounter, where mastery of your weapon's defense and attack capabilities defines your success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Multiplayer Battles</i>: Challenge friends and foes in various multiplayer modes. Prove your dominance in one-on-one duels or engage in larger, chaotic skirmishes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Conquest Campaign</i>: Conquer the vast lands of Valia, solo or in co-op. Navigate through interconnected nodes to conquer diverse areas, including fiefs, fortresses, and cities. Lead your army, ride powerful steeds, or operate advanced vehicles to dominate the battlefield. Conquer and manage nodes to earn Shards, the essential currency for your campaign. Spend Shards on new units, powerful perks, and upgrades to bolster your forces and gain the upper hand in the war.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Customization and Progression</i>: Tailor your warrior\u2019s appearance and abilities. Unlock new weapons, armor, and cosmetics as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A Sci-Fi Feudal Realm</i>: Fight in stages where futuristic landscapes are fused with feudal aesthetics and traditions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078430/extras/a6e378a8623efc3d34ea72b91422505c.poster.avif?t=1732618875\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078430/extras/a6e378a8623efc3d34ea72b91422505c.webm?t=1732618875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078430/extras/a6e378a8623efc3d34ea72b91422505c.mp4?t=1732618875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Community</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become part of the Luminedge community and share your experiences, strategies, and feedback. Follow us on social media, join our forums, and participate in our events to stay up-to-date with the latest news and updates.</p>",
